This package is an independent implementation owned by vicschan. Its engine
subclasses the public API of the official DSH compaction packages
(@deepseek-ai/dsh-compaction and @deepseek-ai/dsh-compaction-basic), which it
resolves from the running DSH install at runtime; no source of theirs is copied
or bundled into this package — resolution happens at mount.

No vendored or third-party compaction library is used, imported, bundled or
depended upon. This package declares no npm dependencies, its node_modules holds
only pnpm bookkeeping files, and every non-Node import in index.mjs, lib/,
scripts/ and test/ resolves either to a module of this package or to an official
@deepseek-ai/dsh-* host package.

